---
import HeroSpecimen from './HeroSpecimen';
import { catalog, catalogCounts, categories } from '../lib/catalog';
const statLabels = { components:'Components', originals:'Arifian Originals', motion:'Motion studies', patterns:'Interface patterns' };
---
<div class="home" data-design-direction="minimalist-brutalism">
  <section class="hero page-width" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>PERSONAL DESIGN SYSTEM</p><h1 id="hero-title">Interfaces with<br class="desktop-break" /> less noise and<br class="desktop-break" /> <span>more intent.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">Components, interactions, and interface patterns shaped around Terracotta Minimalist Brutalism. Warm surfaces. Clear decisions. Room to breathe.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary-link" href="/components/">Explore Components <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/foundations/">See Foundations <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="hero-footnote">A visual language by Arifian Saputra.</p></div><HeroSpecimen client:load /></section>
  <section class="system-stats page-width" aria-label="Inside the system">{Object.entries(catalogCounts).map(([kind,count])=><a href={kind === 'components' ? '/components/' : `/${kind}/`} data-stat={kind} data-count={count}><strong>{String(count).padStart(2,'0')}</strong><span>{statLabels[kind as keyof typeof statLabels]}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>)}</section>
  <section class="explore-section page-width" aria-labelledby="explore-title"><div class="section-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE BUILDING BLOCKS</p><h2 id="explore-title">A common language.<br /><span>Plenty of possibilities.</span></h2></div><p>From the smallest action to a complete interface. Each part carries the same attention to type, space, and behavior.</p></div><div class="category-bento">{categories.map((category,index)=><a href={`/components/${category.slug}/`} class:list={['category-card',`category-${category.slug}`]}><div class="category-meta"><span>0{index+1}</span><span>{catalog.filter(entry=>entry.category === category.slug && entry.kind === 'component').length} specimens</span></div><div class="category-illustration" aria-hidden="true">{category.slug==='actions'? <><span class="mock-button">Create something ↗</span><span class="mock-button outline">Keep exploring</span></>: category.slug==='forms'? <><span class="mock-label">A place for your ideas</span><span class="mock-input">Field notes<span>│</span></span></>: category.slug==='navigation'? <div class="mock-tabs"><span>Overview</span><span>Notes</span><span>Activity</span></div>: category.slug==='feedback'? <span class="mock-status">✓ A little progress, acknowledged.</span>: category.slug==='data-display'? <div class="mock-bars">{[32,62,44,86,70,96].map(height=><i style={`height:${height}%`} />)}</div>: category.slug==='media'? <div class="mock-media"><img src="/studies/atlas.svg" alt="" width="960" height="600" loading="lazy" /></div>: category.slug==='layout'? <div class="mock-bento"><i /><i /><i /></div>: <div class="mock-overlay"><span>Make space for the details.</span><i>Close ×</i></div>}</div><div class="category-heading"><h3>{category.name}</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>{category.summary}</p></a>)}</div></section>
  <section class="collections-section page-width" aria-labelledby="collections-title"><div class="section-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / BEYOND THE PRIMITIVES</p><h2 id="collections-title">The parts come together.</h2></div><p>Original compositions, quiet movement, and everyday tasks.</p></div><div class="collection-grid"><a href="/originals/" class="collection-card original-card"><p class="eyebrow">ARIFIAN ORIGINALS</p><div class="original-motif" aria-hidden="true"><span>AS.</span><i /><i /></div><h3>A familiar point of view. ↗</h3><p>Bento profiles, editorial cards, project previews, and a small terminal companion.</p></a><a href="/motion/" class="collection-card motion-card"><p class="eyebrow">MOTION STUDIES</p><div class="motion-motif" aria-hidden="true"><span>Collect.</span><span>Consider.</span><span>Create.</span></div><h3>A little movement, with purpose. ↗</h3><p>Replayable transitions that guide attention and respect a quieter preference.</p></a><a href="/patterns/" class="collection-card pattern-card"><p class="eyebrow">INTERFACE PATTERNS</p><div class="pattern-motif" aria-hidden="true"><i /><i /><i /><i /><i /></div><h3>Ready for real decisions. ↗</h3><p>Application layouts, conversations, collections, and the spaces between them.</p></a></div></section>
  <section class="closing-note page-width"><p class="eyebrow">THE WORKING PRINCIPLE</p><p>Less to get in the way.<br /><span>More to build with.</span></p><a class="text-link" href="/foundations/">Get to know the foundations <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</div>
